# =====================================================================
# The CORE suite is fully OFFLINE and needs NO keys. Everything that
# scores the artifact runs without this file:
#   python -m validation.run_checks    --target environments/fixed_lab/configs
#   python -m validation.replay_attack --target environments/fixed_lab/configs
#   python -m pytest tests/ -q
# =====================================================================

# ONLY the optional stretch goal (validation/adaptive_agent.py) uses a key.
# Somay does NOT have an Anthropic key -> this piece is skippable; the
# submission is complete without it. If a teammate wants to run it:
#
#   1. Go to https://console.anthropic.com  and sign in / sign up.
#   2. Billing -> add a little credit (the API is pay-as-you-go; a few $ is plenty).
#   3. API Keys -> Create Key -> copy the value (starts with "sk-ant-...").
#   4. Copy this file to `.env` and paste the key below. `.env` is gitignored;
#      NEVER commit a real key.
#   5. Use model id "claude-sonnet-5" (or "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001" to spend less).
#
# NOTE: our AgentRouter/Codex proxy will NOT work here - it is UA-gated to the
# Codex CLI only, so a plain Python script cannot reach it. It needs a direct key.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=            # optional: adaptive-agent stretch only; leave blank to skip
